Z||000000||NOS3800||10-22-2001||09:51 PM||||Ok, I sitting at a traffic light waiting for the light to change. This red Mustang 5.0 makes a right turn from my left. I guess he saw me, and decided to show off . He punches the gas halfway through the turn. <BR>The rear end swings around, tires squealing and POW!! Right into the ditch!! I was laughing my ass off. The light turned green and I just drove away. DUMBASS!! At the next light,the Toyaota pickup that was behind me at the previous light pulled up beside me. He says," Have you ever seen anything so stoopid?"<BR><P>------------------<BR>Purple 1988 GT<BR>NOS injected 3800 Series II V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sig_Pic,_nos3800_3.jpg"> <BR>Best ET(75 shot)-13.21@102.13 mph<BR>w/o NOS 14.86@92.06mph||||reg||11
