Z||000036||Master_Sushi||10-23-2001||09:22 PM||||Errrrrrrrrrr... I feel like I’m getting flamed now. Let me point out FIEROS HANDEL BETTER THEN MUSTANGS. I know this, I've driven a few Mustangs and am on my second Fiero now. That’s not the point I made earlier, and if some of you warped what I said into something else...So be it...<P>I’m sorry to say but it does seem Fiero people get WAY to worked up about Mustangs. They are both good cars, they are very different! Different cars have different handling. Over all Fiero OBVIOUSLY handles better. Get over it people.<BR>||||reg||11
