Z||000039||fierospeeder||10-23-2001||10:02 PM||||woohoo flame war again, lets vote who to kick off.<P>Anyway, i own a tbird turbo and a fiero and a beetle.<P>The tbird has a skidpad of something like .89 i can look it up.  It handles awesome for being that heavy.  It is a relative of the mustang and a lot of the susp is the same as the stang.  It can come close to doing anything the fiero can.<P>Bad thing about the stang and tbird.  Once it gets wet, or snows.  I have more trouble in the snow then it being wet.  My rear end is so light, i tend to fish tail no matter how slow im moving.||||reg||1
